{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\udee7Manage How You Like\ud83e\udee7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can run your laundry empire either by gaining automated passive income with the machines or by getting your hands dirty and cleaning the clothes of your customers to maximize your earnings. You can hire and manage employees to do your dirty laundry too!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddfdClean With Detail\ud83e\uddfd</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/b2504ae901078adcb5788c8392c4580f.poster.avif?t=1759692085\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/b2504ae901078adcb5788c8392c4580f.webm?t=1759692085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/b2504ae901078adcb5788c8392c4580f.mp4?t=1759692085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can load dirty clothes in the washer, wash them with the washing program of your choice, dry them to save some time, iron the clean clothes for a final touch and detail clean the clothes that your customers bring in. Chop chop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83e\uddf9Take Care of Your Shop\ud83e\uddf9</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/8c37b3e9f6f83c940451e54d00a0fa75.poster.avif?t=1759692085\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/8c37b3e9f6f83c940451e54d00a0fa75.webm?t=1759692085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/8c37b3e9f6f83c940451e54d00a0fa75.mp4?t=1759692085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to clean the dirt your customers or wet clothes make and repair the machines that need fixing. You can decorate your laundromat and buy items how you like. You can upgrade your shop to become the biggest laundromat. Maximize your income and make famous people your regular customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83c\udf40Find Forgotten Item of Customers\ud83c\udf40</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/529c23bd4cde16d9a936e0ca828d11c7.poster.avif?t=1759692085\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/529c23bd4cde16d9a936e0ca828d11c7.webm?t=1759692085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/529c23bd4cde16d9a936e0ca828d11c7.mp4?t=1759692085\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers often forget some of their items in their basket. You can take them or leave them. One man's trash is another man's treasure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fManage and Upgrade Your Equipment\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144450/extras/85b2ae16fdf36e2d5b0706b9013d72ed.poster.avif?t=1759692085\" width=750 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s